| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| $5040$ | $19,15,13,7,4$ | $(735,1190)$ | $2^4 3^2 5 7$ | $-1$ |
| $55440$ | $24,20,17,15,11,6,4$ | $(8088,13088)$ | $2^4 3^2 5 7\cdot11$ | $+1$ |
